      "rationale": "The implementation fuses the softmax reduction and application passes to reduce memory traffic and kernel launches (fusion). Block size increased to 512 to increase useful work per launch and reduce kernel launch overhead. Number of warps increased to 8 and stages to 2 to improve occupancy without enabling tensor cores due to no evidence of benefits. Masking is preserved implicitly by masking boundary loads/stores with neutral values (-inf for max and 0 for others). This addresses identified bottlenecks K05 (fusion), K07 (masking), K09 (launch), and partially K04 (resources). Memory coalescing is maintained by mapping neighboring threads to neighboring addresses.",
